  "content": "\n\n<h1>動態光源</h1>\n<p>為 Minecraft 加入動態光源，所有能發光的物品與發光生物都會產生跟隨它們移動的光線。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Ei1akpCL/images/b273dabd35c9d12f56949b707368459aa1dd3a68.png\" alt=\"1\"></p>\n<h2>光源等級</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:6.90088%;text-align:center\">光源等級</th>\n<th style=\"width:9.65777%;text-align:center\">亮度</th>\n<th style=\"width:65.8755%;text-align:center\">光源</th>\n<th style=\"width:17.5659%;text-align:center\">生物</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:6.90088%;text-align:center\"><strong>15</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:9.65777%;text-align:center\">最亮</td>\n<td style=\"width:65.8755%;text-align:center\">螢石、海晶燈、鐵燈籠、南瓜燈、菌光體、信標、所有青蛙燈（翡翠、珍珠、赭黃）</td>\n<td style=\"width:17.5659%;text-align:center\">烈焰人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:6.90088%;text-align:center\"><strong>14</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:9.65777%;text-align:center\">明亮</td>\n<td style=\"width:65.8755%;text-align:center\">火把、營火、熔岩桶、末地棒</td>\n<td style=\"width:17.5659%;text-align:center\">&mdash;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:6.90088%;text-align:center\"><strong>10</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:9.65777%;text-align:center\">中等</td>\n<td style=\"width:65.8755%;text-align:center\">靈魂火把、靈魂燈籠、靈魂營火、紅石火把、螢光漿果</td>\n<td style=\"width:17.5659%;text-align:center\">熔岩立方、螢光烏賊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:6.90088%;text-align:center\"><strong>7</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:9.65777%;text-align:center\">昏暗</td>\n<td style=\"width:65.8755%;text-align:center\">烈焰棒、烈焰粉、螢石粉、螢光墨囊</td>\n<td style=\"width:17.5659%;text-align:center\">&mdash;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
